					<div id="elementor-tab-content-9821" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="1" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-9821" tabindex="0" hidden="false"><div style="display:flex;gap:44px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:10px 0"><div style="flex:1.2;min-width:280px"><div style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:26px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:14px">Amazon &amp; Noon Marketplace</div><p style="color:#B9B4C7;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 18px;line-height:1.65">Skincare shoppers on Amazon.ae and Noon search by active ingredient and skin concern — &#8220;vitamin C serum dull skin&#8221; — and decide based on review count and before/after imagery. We optimize listings to win that specific search intent.</p><div><span style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);padding:6px 13px;border-radius:999px;margin:0 8px 8px 0;display:inline-block;color:#fff">Concern &amp; ingredient search</span><span style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);padding:6px 13px;border-radius:999px;margin:0 8px 8px 0;display:inline-block;color:#fff">Review-count sensitive</span></div></div><div style="flex:.8;min-width:260px"><div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px"><span style="font-size:13px;color:#A7A2B6">Top keyword type</span><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#C6F432">&#8220;[active] serum UAE&#8221;</b></div><div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px"><span style="font-size:13px;color:#A7A2B6">Marketplace fee (Glowth estimate; check current rate card)</span><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#C6F432">8-15% referral</b></div><div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px"><span style="font-size:13px;color:#A7A2B6">Best lever</span><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#C6F432">A+ Content + before/after imagery</b></div></div></div></div>
