					<div id="elementor-tab-content-9822" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-9822" tabindex="0" hidden="hidden"><div style="display:flex;gap:44px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:10px 0"><div style="flex:1.2;min-width:280px"><div style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:26px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:14px">Skinfluencer &amp; UGC</div><p style="color:#B9B4C7;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 18px;line-height:1.65">Skincare trust is built over weeks of visible-progress content, not a single post. We run structured skinfluencer partnerships that document real usage over a full routine cycle, then repurpose that as ad and listing proof.</p><div><span style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);padding:6px 13px;border-radius:999px;margin:0 8px 8px 0;display:inline-block;color:#fff">Progress-over-time content</span><span style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);padding:6px 13px;border-radius:999px;margin:0 8px 8px 0;display:inline-block;color:#fff">Highest trust signal</span></div></div><div style="flex:.8;min-width:260px"><div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px"><span style="font-size:13px;color:#A7A2B6">Content type</span><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#C6F432">Multi-week progress series</b></div><div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px"><span style="font-size:13px;color:#A7A2B6">Typical program</span><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#C6F432">Gifting + affiliate %</b></div><div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px"><span style="font-size:13px;color:#A7A2B6">Best lever</span><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#C6F432">Micro-creator credibility</b></div></div></div></div>
