a(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px"><span style="font-size:13px;color:#A7A2B6">Best lever</span><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#C6F432">Subscribe-and-save flow</b></div></div></div></div>
									<div class="elementor-tab-title elementor-tab-mobile-title" aria-selected="false" data-tab="5" role="tab" tabindex="-1" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-9825" aria-expanded="false">Registration &amp; Claims</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-9825" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="5" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-9825" tabindex="0" hidden="hidden"><div style="display:flex;gap:44px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:10px 0"><div style="flex:1.2;min-width:280px"><div style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:26px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:14px">Registration &amp; Claims</div><p style="color:#B9B4C7;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 18px;line-height:1.65">Skincare marketed with efficacy claims — &#8220;clinically proven,&#8221; &#8220;reduces fine lines&#8221; — need proper product registration (in Dubai, cosmetics go through Dubai Municipality&#8217;s Montaji portal; health-related products can involve federal regulators) and claim substantiation. We keep marketing aligned with what&#8217;s registered while your product moves through the process.</p><div><span style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);padding:6px 13px;border-radius:999px;margin:0 8px 8px 0;display:inline-block;color:#fff">Compliance-first</span><span style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);padding:6px 13px;border-radius:999px;margin:0 8px 8px 0;display:inline-block;color:#fff">Runs alongside registration</span></div></div><div style="flex:.8;min-width:260px"><div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px"><span style="font-size:13px;color:#A7A2B6">Requires</span><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#C6F432">Product registration (e.g. Montaji)</b></div><div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px"><span style="font-size:13px;color:#A7A2B6">Risk if skipped</span><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#C6F432">Ad account &amp; listing bans</b></div><div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px"><span style="font-size:13px;color:#A7A2B6">Best lever</span><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#C6F432">Compliant claims review</b></div></div></div></div>
