				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bd6d472 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="bd6d472" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C3AED;margin:0"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#FF2E7E,#7C3AED);border-radius:2px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle"></span>Why niche wins</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1e27435d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="1e27435d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Why a skincare brand <span class="hl">sells trust and a routine, not a bottle</span></h2>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ec92b45 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="ec92b45" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-76e4264d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="76e4264d" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1bae8ba0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="1bae8ba0" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>A single serum sale is worth little compared to a customer locked into a repeat routine. Skincare marketing has to build multi-week trust and a bundle path — treating it like a one-off product sale wastes the category&#8217;s real revenue engine.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5e2533b8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="5e2533b8" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Progress content is the strategy</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-397c109b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="397c109b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Before/after and multi-week progress content substantiates efficacy in a way a single studio shot never can — and it&#8217;s the single biggest content advantage this category has.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5c4129d5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="5c4129d5" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Compliance shapes what you can claim</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-422f61ed elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="422f61ed" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Product registration and claims substantiation decide what your ads and listings are even allowed to say about &#8220;clinically proven&#8221; or &#8220;reduces fine lines&#8221; — and unsupported claims can get ads rejected or listings pulled. We keep <a href="/google-ads-for-beauty/">Google Shopping and search ads</a> and <a href="/instagram-facebook-ads-for-beauty/">Instagram and Facebook ad creative</a> inside what your product can actually claim.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-264bddf2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="264bddf2" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-367290e8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="367290e8" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 14px">Skincare brands, at a glance</p><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Bundles</b><span>— routine sets lift order value over single SKUs</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Ingredient-led</b><span>— active-ingredient search drives discovery</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Claims-aware</b><span>— efficacy claims matched to registration</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Proof-first</b><span>— real-use progress content builds more trust than studio shots</span></div>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
